    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Vulpin)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can smell fear. You can smell guilt. You can smell the truth trying to hide.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Scent of Secrets (1/a Soma Break).</strong> For 10 minutes, you have reroll the lowest die on Insight (Soul) (Soul), Investigation (Mind) (Mind), and Perception (Mind) (Mind) checks [TODO(adv-call)] to detect deception, hidden compartments, secret doors, or concealed items.</p>",
